    description: "Add ArityFlags dataclass (param_count, has_defaults, has_varargs, has_kwargs) and classify_parameter_flags(params_node) hook to TreeSitterAnalyzer. Default implementation counts children and checks common node types. Per-language overrides for: Java (spread_parameter), JS/TS (rest_pattern, assignment_pattern), Ruby (splat_parameter, hash_splat_parameter, optional_parameter), Go (no defaults/varargs — flags False). ~30 lines per language. See ADR-0014 §2."  # 640e
